    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 02 VISUAL GUIDE</div>\n    <h4>The aissistant: an agent is a configuration, and safety is two questions</h4>\n    <p>The builder, the skill contract, and the two primitives that make an agent safe</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 350\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-02\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-02\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-02\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE BUILDER</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">@n8n/agents v0.29.0</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">25+ configuration methods</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">lazily built — build() is</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">PROTECTED (user code never</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">calls it) — an agent is data</text>\n      </g>\n      <path d=\"M 230 95 L 268 95\" stroke=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-02)\"/>\n      <g transform=\"translate(272, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE SKILL</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a validated SKILL.md</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">72 KB output cap</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">content-hashed linked files</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">declared MCP dependencies</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">the study’s most complete</text>\n      </g>\n      <path d=\"M 482 95 L 520 95\" stroke=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-02)\"/>\n      <g transform=\"translate(524, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"180\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">DELEGATION</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a first-class tool</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">suspend / resume</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a max-children cap</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">+ a difficulty rating</text>\n      </g>\n      <path d=\"M 704 95 L 742 95\" stroke=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-02)\"/>\n      <g transform=\"translate(746, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"154\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE COST STOP</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a SpendLedger</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">idempotent per callId</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a per-session cap</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">+ a monthly budget</text>\n      </g>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"196\" width=\"430\" height=\"136\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#059669\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"222\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#047857\">TWO PRIMITIVES, TWO MOMENTS</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"246\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">1 · a guardrail IS \"allow\" or \"stop(code)\"</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"266\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">   run BEFORE a model call AND before a tool call</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">2 · tool output is UNTRUSTED input — invisible</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"310\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">   Unicode stripped, wrapped with its source</text>\n      <rect x=\"470\" y=\"196\" width=\"430\" height=\"136\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ef4444\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"222\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">THE BOUNDARY OF THIS POLE</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"246\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">The agent's tools are its tools. Where a tool reaches</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"266\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">an MCP server or a platform capability, the IDENTITY</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"286\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">it reaches them as is not decided here.</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"312\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">The tenancy-aware tool door is the platform's (b03).</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
