    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 03 VISUAL GUIDE</div>\n    <h4>The workspace: the cleanest tenancy model in the study</h4>\n    <p>One container with two modes, membership as a row, and permissions as a vocabulary</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 350\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-03\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-03\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-03\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"880\" height=\"150\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" fill-opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">ONE OBJECT, TWO MODES — Project.type = personal | team</text>\n      <g transform=\"translate(40, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE CONTAINER</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Project: personal | team</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">your space & your team’s are</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">the SAME object</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(256, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE MEMBERSHIP</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a join row (userId, projectId)</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">carrying a Role by SLUG</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">custom role → no migration</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(472, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE ROLES</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">global (owner/admin/member)</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">+ resource-level, per thing</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">2 levels, kept apart</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(688, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE IDENTITY</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">User + AuthIdentity + ApiKey</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">one person, several logins</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">unique per provider</text>\n      </g>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"196\" width=\"430\" height=\"136\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"222\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">206 resource:action SCOPES</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"246\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Nothing asks \"are you an admin?\" — it asks</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"266\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">\"may you do X to this?\" A vocabulary, not a question.</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">4 of the 5 scope files are .ee — read, reimplement.</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"314\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">Sharing reuses membership: a join row + a role.</text>\n      <rect x=\"470\" y=\"196\" width=\"430\" height=\"136\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#b45309\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"222\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#b45309\">THE BOUNDARY — ACTIONS, NOT ROWS</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"246\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">The scopes gate ACTIONS. Where a ROW-LEVEL read</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"266\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">decision is needed, that is a finer grain than the scope</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"286\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">vocabulary expresses — a boundary, not a gap.</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"312\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#b45309\">Batch 01's CLI silence: the model is the server's (F03-10).</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
